	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050120"},
		line=856,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I apologize for causing you such concern.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Already on her feet just two days later, the first thing Kotone does is find me and Akari.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you feeling better now?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes! I have made a complete recovery!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"She beams at us, flexing her biceps.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I cannot thank you enough, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you had not arrived to save me, I would never have escaped from that place.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Kotone offers me a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You never did end up telling me. What exactly did you do to bring her back?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not sure what you're imagining. I just did what I could to cheer her up.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, Soujin-sama, there you go again.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I still remember every last word, I will have you know!”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You cradled me to your chest and whispered in my ear,\n'There's no way I'd ever leave you behind in a place like\nthis,' did you not?!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm, did I now?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And then, and then! You shouted to the world, 'I refuse to be the sort of coward who'd abandon his betrothed!' Remember?!”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha... If you say so...”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, let us go reaffirm our vows to each other in front of the altar!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Kotone excitedly points towards the ceremony hall in the shrine.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Seems like you two are getting along reeeal nicely...”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"In contrast, Akari is staring daggers at me.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, what's the harm? We should just be glad Kotone's alive and well.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, indeed I am!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, oh dear...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Swaying on her feet, Kotone grabs the nearby handrail for support.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Whoa there, you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, I am right as rain.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Knowing Kotone, she's definitely putting up a strong front.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My own condition aside, however...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How are you faring, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Was the ritual able to restore some of your former strength?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Akari and I share a brief look.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"It's probably best to tell Kotone the honest truth.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks to you, I think I've recovered the strength of an ordinary warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But unfortunately, I'm still far from being as strong as Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, I see...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I expected Kotone to be dejected, but her expression\ndoesn't change in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case, let us conduct the ritual once more.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With that, you will surely─”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Absolutely not. You're not using any more magicks. Period.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-Whyever not?!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Kotone stammers in shock at the firmness of Akari's rejection.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Have you seriously forgotten what just happened to you?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You nearly died back there.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I proceeded with the ritual fully prepared for such an eventuality.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Exalt-Priestess is Mitsurugi's bride.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My sole purpose is to serve Mitsurugi-sama... To serve Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And what're we supposed to do if you get yourself killed just like that?!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Another Exalt-Priestess will rise to take my place.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Akari's furor does nothing to extinguish the resolve burning in Kotone's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am sure you must be quite jealous, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What's that supposed to mean?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You are obviously dissatisfied with me fulfilling my duties as his bride.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What does that have to do with anything?!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You just want to keep Soujin-sama all to yourself. Hmph!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now listen here, you!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stop saying these weird things in front of Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"The two girls glare at each other.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't just stand there, Soujin. Talk some sense into her.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll just say this one thing.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"I've been holding it back all this time.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Now's my chance to finally speak my mind.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're going to fight, do it elsewhere.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Everyone's staring at us.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?” “Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Two pairs of eyes mechanically swivel around, finally taking in their surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"They're met with the dozens of wide-eyed expressions from Inner Iseya's priests and priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah... Kotone, let's call a truce.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, let's.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The two of them look down in embarrassment.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Oh dear. You have my sympathies.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"When we tell Isuzu what happened earlier, she merely giggles in amusement.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This is no laughing matter! Oh... I went and made such a fool of myself.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Now, now, why don't we just enjoy some nice persimmons?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Isuzu plucks a handful of persimmons from the trees in the courtyard, proceeding to peel them one by one.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama and Akari-sama, please do have a taste as well. They are most delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't mind if I do.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“These are well-ripened.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Ripe persimmons foretell the changing of the seasons.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Winter will be upon us all too soon.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, these are great!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed they are... Haahmm!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Kotone snatches another persimmon for herself as soon as Isuzu finishes peeling it.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really love these, don't you, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed! The local persimmons in particular are wonderfully delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And I have many fond memories of eating them right here in Iseya with Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, yeah. We did do that, didn't we?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari lived here in Iseya after fleeing Tenkyo, right?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes. Though at the time, I never could have imagined that she was the Imperial Princess.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“'The Lord of Mount Momiji,' was it?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yet, to think that she would turn out to be the lord of the whole Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The first time I met Akari-sama, it was right around persimmon season...”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Kotone begins fondly reminiscing about days past.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Imperial Seminary is where we priestesses receive our training, and its rigors are not to be taken lightly.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Among those in my cohort, less than one in ten were able to successfully graduate.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Becoming a priestess must be hard work, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Akari and I each settle down with a persimmon, listening to Kotone's reminiscences.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“On top of that, I carried the Shiinoha name, being born to a long and eminent lineage of priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was scolded more than anyone else for being a disgrace to my ancestors... Indeed, every single day back then was a mighty struggle.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hence, I ran away from the seminary on more than a few occasions.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wouldn't that just make things even worse for you?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Running away was just one additional item on the long list of things I would inevitably get scolded for.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In which case, I thought to myself that I might as well enjoy myself in between my scoldings!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, at the time. That is what I thought at the time.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Kotone stares fondly off into the distance for some time before continuing.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“After making my great escape, I would always simply wander around aimlessly. That is, until one day, I came upon Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My first impression of her... was that of a terribly frightful person.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Enduring her grandmother's harsh rebukes, she swung her blade with a single-minded devotion, picking herself up off the ground over and over...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why, she seemed more vengeful spirit than flesh-and-blood human...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I remember hearing this story from Kotone before.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thinking it strange, I asked Akari-sama why she subjected herself to such harsh training.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This is how she answered me:”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“'I have a duty I must fulfill, even at the cost of my life.'”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Seriously? I actually said that?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you not remember?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Back then, I wasn't really thinking about anything but training.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"In just a few short years, this girl who'd never before held a blade managed to attain enough mastery to stand toe-to-toe with a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was struck speechless.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is all too easy to ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"say",
{"/font"},
" that you will lay down your life.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But Akari-sama embodied that vow with her every act.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The depth of her resolve allowed her even to endure such harsh training.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall never forget the look in her eyes as she said that to me.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It made me realize for the very first time that the pain I felt was nothing in comparison.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs in a soft voice.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Really, I'm nothing special.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was just desperate, is all. Back then, the only thought on my mind was avenging my mother.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Akari shows us a smile tinged with sorrow.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And that desperation of yours resonated with me. More than you ever knew.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That was why I visited you so regularly.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The sight of you trying so hard never failed to fill me up with courage.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I just thought you wanted to fill up on persimmons.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“N-Not at all! How could you possibly accuse me of such shallow motivations?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...The persimmons ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"were",
{"/font"},
" awfully delicious, though.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Now that sounds a lot more like Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“At any rate, it was all thanks to Akari-sama that I realized what was most important to me.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, I'm glad I could help.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"The two of them share a smile as they munch on their persimmons.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"I'm sure they'll remain close friends even long after peace returns to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How far is the house Akari lived in from here?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm, I do not suppose it would be more than a half day's journey.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've decided to not visit Satonaka until I've restored the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Though originally, my plan was to report back to her after avenging my mother.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Akari declares calmly, but her eyes reflect a firm resolve.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, then.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go pay her a visit after everything is settled.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, I believe I had the pleasure of making Satonaka-sama's acquaintance.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Silently listening up until now, Isuzu finally opens her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Really?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“If I recall, it was in the spring that she paid the Imperial Seminary a visit.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Satonaka-sama sought Healing magicks capable of easing her granddaughter's suffering.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“She was deeply disappointed to learn that magicks could only be wielded by those born to bloodlines chosen by Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Her granddaughter...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"That could be no one else but Akari.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe that your grandmother must have truly cherished you, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Satonaka...”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Akari hangs her head, her hands trembling in her lap.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"We each carry in our hearts that which is most precious to us.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Which is why even now, Satonaka's memory is surely being kept alive deep within Akari.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, I wanna have a talk.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Can you make some time for me later?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes ma'am, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"The vast Iseyan sky is reflected back at me in the depths of\nAkari's resolved gaze.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
